  "goodToKnow": "Das Kohlendioxid is carbon dioxide, usually just called CO₂ (tsay-oh-tsvai): der CO₂-Ausstoß, CO₂-neutral. Since 2021, Germany has charged a national CO₂-Preis on petrol, diesel, heating oil and gas, rising year by year. Kohlenmonoxid is carbon monoxide. Die Kohle means coal and, colloquially, money: Ich hab keine Kohle. It has no plural."
